tor ranged from: Mudrock, Eunectes, and Ceobe)","Type-γ Headhunting Permit (Possible 6-star Operator ranged from: Kal'tsit, Blemishine, and Mizuki)","After completing the customization and purchase, you will get the corresponding customization permit. Using the Headhunting Permit will perform a [Special Ten-roll Headhunting] and will randomly get one of the 6-star Operators appearing in the customization Headhunting Permit.","SPECIAL TEN-ROLL HEADHUNTING DETAILS :","You may select only one of the customization within this Special Headhunting Pack to purchase. It can only be purchased once and you cannot change your decision after purchasing.","This headhunting is part of [Special Ten-roll Headhunting]. When you headhunt in [Special Ten-roll Headhunting], rolls that do not give a 6-star Operator will not count towards the 6-star mechanism, nor will it affect your accumulated roll count in [Standard Headhunting]. The rate in this headhunting is not affected by your accumulated roll count in [Standard Headhunting] either.","When headhunting in [Special Ten-roll Headhunting], you are guaranteed to receive a 6-star Operator within 10 rolls. The available 6-star Operator depends on the customization chosen.","NOTE:","Expiration time of Special Ten-roll Headhunting Permit: September 16, 2022, 03:59 (UTC-7)","You may only use the Special Ten-roll Headhunting Permit once.","If not used by the expiration date, the Special Ten-roll Headhunting Permit will be removed from your Depot, so please make sure to use it before it expires.","In addition to a guaranteed 6-star Operator with the customization, the odds of obtaining different operators in [Special Ten-roll Headhunting] are as follow:","★★★★★★: 2%","★★★★★: 8%","★★★★: 50%","★★★: 40%"],"imagePath":null}]}],"furniture":[{"title":"Shan-Ch'eng Teahouse","source":"building_data furni_set_teaHouse","description":"A reproduction of a Shangshu teahouse. Kroos and Mr. Nothing strongly recommend enjoying tea before the majesty of nat